number: XVIII
name: The Harlequin
path: M23.45 48.574h33.5v-33.5h-33.5zM40.2 6.7v67m-26.802 0L40.2 6.7l26.8 67
viewbox: 80.4
uprightMeaning: illusion, shadow, masked depth
reversedMeaning: fog parting, named fear
tags: season:winter, element:water, gem:sapphire, flower:orchid
flavor: The path across the water looks solid by moonlight. The wolves are not fooled.

--- upright
The shapes on the path were always stones. The moon hides this. By morning the stones remain stones, and someone has walked into the water.
---

--- reversed
The mask falls in the firelight. The face beneath is smaller than the mask. The fear had been wearing the wrong shape.
---
